end

--- Last-hit record from the monster FSM's own hit memory (.position, .count, who, time), nil below the bind or no mob.
--- The .count gate matters: a never-hit monster anchors retreat logic at the world origin, so consumers check count > 0 first.
--- @safety SAFE - nil-guarded, nil below the bind
--- @cost O(1) | 1 luabind trivial (CMonsterHitMemory read)
--- @src modded-exes/lua_help_ex.script (get_monster_hit_info), xray/ai/monsters/monster_hit_memory.cpp:156 (the origin default)
--- @param mob game_object monster
--- @return userdata|nil the hit info, nil when unavailable
function xmonster.get_monster_hit_info(mob)
    if not mob or not _has_bind(mob, "get_monster_hit_info") then return nil end
    return mob:get_monster_hit_info()
end

--- Last-heard-sound record from the monster FSM's own sound memory (.type, .count, position, power), nil below the bind.
--- @safety SAFE - nil-guarded, nil below the bind
--- @cost O(1) | 1 luabind trivial (CMonsterSoundMemory read)
--- @src modded-exes/lua_help_ex.script (get_sound_info)
--- @param mob game_object monster
--- @return userdata|nil the sound info, nil when unavailable
function xmonster.get_monster_sound_info(mob)
    if not mob or not _has_bind(mob, "get_sound_info") then return nil end
    return mob:get_sound_info()
