--- @return userdata|nil the home info, nil when unavailable
function xmonster.get_monster_home_info(mob)
    if not mob or not _has_bind(mob, "get_monster_home_info") then return nil end
    return mob:get_monster_home_info()
end

--- The monster movement record (velocity_current/target/real + path_completed/actual + path_capturer) for slow/stuck diagnosis, nil below the bind.
--- @safety SAFE - nil-guarded, nil below the bind
--- @cost O(1) | 1 luabind trivial (CControlMovement + CMovementManager reads)
--- @src modded-exes/lua_help_ex.script (get_monster_movement_info)
--- @param mob game_object monster
--- @return userdata|nil the movement info, nil when unavailable
function xmonster.get_monster_movement_info(mob)
